  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Env-Dw 103.59 “System with a single service connection” means a system that supplies drinking water to consumers via a single service line.\n\nSource. (See Revision Note at chapter heading for Env-Dw 100) #10606, eff 6-1-14; renumbered by #10770 (from Env-Dw 103.57); renumbered by #12180 (from Env-Dw 103.58)",
